# head/adult/man/brow_heavy: the man's heavy brows: 3 px, dark
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to FACES in wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel
# and the mouth row (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role brow heavy
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
tags mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -3 -8
|baa....aab

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -11 -8
|aab

view L key rest origin -2 -8
|baa

# (P2b FACES) elven fineness: thinner, swept-up brows and a finer nose for elves (when elf replace)
view D key rest origin -4 -7 when elf replace
|b......b
|.aa..aa.

view R key rest origin -11 -7 when elf replace
|b.
|.a

view L key rest origin -3 -7 when elf replace
|.b
|a.
